  <!-- EN: Laborers arrived -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborersArrived.slateRef>Trabalhadores chegaram</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborersArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The laborers from [permitFaction_name] have arrived. A shuttle will come to collect them in [laborersDurationDays] days. -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborersArrived.slateRef>Os trabalhadores de [permitFaction_name] chegaram. Um vaivém virá buscá-los dentro de [laborersDurationDays] dias.</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborersArrived.slateRef>
