  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextShuttleArrivedForLaborers.slateRef>Um vaivém chegou para recolher os trabalhadores de [permitFaction_name].</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextShuttleArrivedForLaborers.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Laborer died: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerDied.slateRef>Trabalhador morreu: {SUBJECT_definite}</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerDied.slateRef>
