  <!-- EN: Laborer abandoned: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>Trabalhador abandonado: {SUBJECT_definite}</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterLabelLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: A laborer sent to you by [permitFaction_name] has been left behind. Any remaining laborers will now leave. -->
  <Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>Um trabalhador enviado por [permitFaction_name] foi deixado para trás. Os restantes trabalhadores vão agora partir.</Permit_CallLaborers.LetterTextLaborerLeftBehind.slateRef>

